message: If you use this knowledge graph in your research, please cite it as follows.
title: "Pediatric Surgery Knowledge Graph: an evidence-based KG of 26 common pediatric surgical diseases (小儿外科常见疾病循证知识图谱)"
version: 0.5
date-released: 2026-08-28
authors:
