keywords:
  - pediatric surgery
  - knowledge graph
  - clinical decision support
  - differential diagnosis
  - Neo4j
  - 小儿外科
  - 知识图谱
  - 临床决策支持
abstract: >-
  An evidence-based knowledge graph for pediatric surgery clinical decision
  support, covering 26 diseases, 266 nodes, 401 relations and 29
  differential-diagnosis pairs, structurally extracted from 35 national and
  international clinical guidelines and expert consensuses, with every
  relation traceable to its source guideline entry.
